Z||000011||theogre||12-01-2001||04:00 PM||||Before you install tinted ones.... consider visibility is not real good to start with.<P>For a test... Tape some paper or plastic over the existing sails.... Now sit in the car and try to imgine backing out of a parking space.... Depending on how much tint there is, you could have a real problem. Those of us with notch backs already have this problem... I've learned to avoid parking spaces I'll have to back out of into heavy traffic. If I think I'll have to back out, I park in less trafficed sections of the parking lots.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
